msgid "Microsoft Outlook has a number of shortcomings in its implementation of the iCalendar standard; this option works around one of them. If you have problems with Outlook users not being able to get your replies, try setting this option."
msgstr "Microsoft Outlook ünnerstütt den iCalendar-Standard nich heel richtig, disse Optschoon arbeidt an een vun disse Fehlers vörbi. Wenn Outlook-Brukers Dien Antwoorden nich kriegt, versöök dat mit disse Optschoon."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (LegacyBodyInvites), group (Invitations)
#. +> trunk stable
#: messageviewer.kcfg.cmake:167
msgid "Send groupware invitations in the mail body"
msgstr "Arbeitkoppel-Inladen binnen Hööftdeel loosstüern"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (LegacyBodyInvites), group (Invitations)
#. +> trunk stable
#: messageviewer.kcfg.cmake:168
msgid "Microsoft Outlook has a number of shortcomings in its implementation of the iCalendar standard; this option works around one of them. If you have problems with Outlook users not being able to get your invitations, try setting this option."
msgstr "Microsoft Outlook ünnerstütt den iCalendar-Standard nich heel richtig, disse Optschoon arbeidt an een vun disse Fehlers vörbi. Wenn Outlook-Brukers Dien Inladen nich kriegt, versöök dat mit disse Optschoon."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ExchangeCompatibleInvitations), group (Invitations)
#. +> trunk stable
#: messageviewer.kcfg.cmake:173
msgid "Exchange-compatible invitation naming"
msgstr "Inladen kompatibel to MS Exchange nömen"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ExchangeCompatibleInvitations), group (Invitations)
#. +> trunk stable
#: messageviewer.kcfg.cmake:174
msgid "Microsoft Outlook, when used in combination with a Microsoft Exchange server, has a problem understanding standards-compliant groupware email. Turn this option on to send groupware invitations in a way that Microsoft Exchange understands."
msgstr "\"Microsoft Outlook\" hett, wenn dat tosamen mit en \"Microsoft Exchange Server\" bruukt warrt, Problemen bi't Verstahn vun Arbeitkoppel-Nettpost, de langs den Standard opstellt wöör. Maak dit an, wenn ok MS Exchange Dien Arbeitkoppel-Inladen verstahn könen schall."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (OutlookCompatibleInvitationReplyComments), group (Invitations)
#. +> trunk stable
#: messageviewer.kcfg.cmake:180
msgid "When replying to invitations, send the reply comment in way that Microsoft Outlook understands."
msgstr "Bi't Antern op Inladen den Anterkommentar so loosstüern, dat ok Microsoft Outlook em versteiht."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (AutomaticSending), group (Invitations)
#. +> trunk stable
#: messageviewer.kcfg.cmake:191
msgid "Automatic invitation sending"
msgstr "Inladen automaatsch loosstüern"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (AutomaticSending), group (Invitations)
#. +> trunk stable
#: messageviewer.kcfg.cmake:192
msgid "When this is checked, you will not see the mail composer window. Instead, all invitation mails are sent automatically. If you want to see the mail before sending it, you can uncheck this option. However, be aware that the text in the composer window is in iCalendar syntax, and you should not try modifying it by hand."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, duukt de Nettbreef-Editor nich op, ansteed warrt all Inladen automaatsch loosstüert. Wenn Du de Naricht ehr't Loosstüern ankieken wullt, maak disse Optschoon ut. Beacht bitte, de Text is in iCalendar-Schriefwies is, Du schullst em nich per Hand bewerken."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (DeleteInvitationEmailsAfterSendingReply), group (Invitations)
#. +> trunk stable
#: messageviewer.kcfg.cmake:198
msgid "When this is checked, received invitation emails that have been replied to will be moved to the Trash folder, once the reply has been successfully sent."
msgstr "Is dit anmaakt, warrt Inladen-Nettbreven, de en Antwoort kregen hebbt, na de Affalltünn verschaven."

